### Testar conexão
GET http://localhost:5000/api/teste/conexao
Accept: application/json


### Criar usuário
POST http://localhost:5000/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Thiago",
  "email": "thiago@email.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}


### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "thiago@email.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}


### Listar usuários
GET http://localhost:5000/api/usuarios
Accept: application/json


### Criar reunião presencial
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reunioes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tituloReuniao": "Reuniao teste",
  "pautaReuniao": "Teste do backend com MySQL",
  "dataReuniao": "2026-05-20",
  "horaInicio": "09:00:00",
  "horaFim": "10:00:00",
  "localReuniao": "Sala A29",
  "linkReuniao": null,
  "idUsuarioLogado": 1,
  "tipoReuniao": "PRESENCIAL"
}


### Listar minhas reuniões
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reunioes/minhas?idUsuarioLogado=1
Accept: application/json


### Listar convites
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reunioes/convites?idUsuarioLogado=1
Accept: application/json